---
layout: null
permalink: /sitemap.xml
---
<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
{% assign site_origin = site.url | default: 'https://zaryob.github.io' %}
{% assign site_root = '/' | relative_url | prepend: site_origin %}
{% comment %}
Every view is a client-side state of one document whose canonical URL is the
site root, so only that URL is listed. Query-string views (?arch=, ?lang=)
would contradict the canonical link in the layout.
{% endcomment %}
<urlset xmlns="http://www.sitemaps.org/schemas/sitemap/0.9">
  <url>
    <loc>{{ site_root }}</loc>
    {% if site.data.syscall_release.updated %}<lastmod>{{ site.data.syscall_release.updated }}</lastmod>{% endif %}
    <changefreq>weekly</changefreq>
    <priority>1.0</priority>
  </url>
</urlset>
